# Workspace root. Copy Brain env into the Brain app:
#   cp apps/brain/.env.example apps/brain/.env
#
# Railway / Inngest still set the same process env names (no new Neon/Inngest apps).
# OS does not get a duplicate Neon / Railway / Inngest project.
# OS auth is separate from Brain APP_PASSWORD. OS does not require Tavily.
# M3 held until shared Neon smoke.
#
# Canonical env templates:
#   apps/brain/.env.example   (Brain APP_PASSWORD + Brain Neon)
#   apps/os/.env.example      (OS JWT + schema os; not Brain APP_PASSWORD)
